    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d303-a2">

                <pb facs="0583" n="513" sameAs="frus:frus1883/pg513"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Superintendent of northwest mounted police to
                        department of the interior of Canada.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Northwest Mounted Police Headquarters</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Regina</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1883-05-08"><hi rendition="#italic">May</hi>
                            8, 1883</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: In the absence of the commissioner, I have
                    the honor to inclose herewith copy of a communication I am just in receipt of
                    from Inspector Macdonell, commanding northwest mounted police post at Wood
                    Mountain.</p>
                <p>I have, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>JOHN COTTON,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Superintendent and
                            Adjutant.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
